OL,3,GNEWSA'Postcode lottery' driving
OL,4,Achildren's inequality in England,
OL,5,Acommissioner warns
OL,6,
OL,7,FServices for children are in a "state
OL,8,Fof emergency" and young people across
OL,9,FEngland are facing extreme and unfair
OL,10,Finequality, a new report says.
OL,12,FChildren's Commissioner for England
OL,13,FDame Rachel de Souza has analysed a
OL,14,Fhundred different metrics including
OL,15,Fhealth and social care, education,
OL,16,Fsafety and play, concluding that a
OL,17,F"postcode lottery" has resulted in a
OL,18,F"litany of failures" affecting
OL,19,Fchildren.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
